#Discord Moderation Bot

Python Discord bot built with 'discord.py' featuring basic moderation and commands.

##Features
-Profanity Filter (user warning + message deletion)
-Welcome message on member join
-Role utilities (assign/remove)
-Role-gated commands
-Simple poll command with reactions (mock poll in Discord)

##Commands
- '!hello' - Greeting 
- '!assign' - Assign a configured role (default: 'agent')
- '!remove' - Remove the configured role
- '!agent' - Role-gated command
- '!dm' - Send DM
- '!reply' - Replies to your DM
- '!poll <questions>' - Create a yes/no poll

##Setup
1. Create a Discord Bot and invite it to your server
2. Create a '.env' file in the project root
3. Install dependencies:
  pip install -r requirements.txt
4 Run the bot:
  python main.py
